  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와일드 존은 정말 최고야!\n매일 잉어킹을 잡을 수 있다니!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C640C77CB4DC0020C874C7400020C815B9D00020CD5CACE0C57C0021000AB9E4C77C0020C789C5B4D0B9C7440020C7A1C7440020C2180020C788B2E4B2C80021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이것 봐!\n특대 사이즈의 잉어킹을 잡았다고!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n‘능력치를 본다’에서 확인했을 때\nXL 사이즈였으니 틀림없어!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774AC830020BD100021000AD2B9B3000020C0ACC774C988C7580020C789C5B4D0B9C7440020C7A1C558B2E4ACE0002100100001BE01000A2018B2A5B825CE58B97C0020BCF8B2E42019C5D0C11C0020D655C778D588C7440020B54C000A0058004C0020C0ACC774C988C600C73CB2C80020D2C0B9BCC5C6C5B400210021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "어마어마하게 커다랗고\n어마어마하게 잘 튀어 오른다니까!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5B4B9C8C5B4B9C8D558AC8C0020CEE4B2E4B797ACE0000AC5B4B9C8C5B4B9C8D558AC8C0020C7980020D280C5B40020C624B978B2E4B2C8AE4C0021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "후후, 내 잉어킹보다\n커다란 잉어킹은 이 세상에 없을걸!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C4D6C4002C0020B0B40020C789C5B4D0B9BCF4B2E4000ACEE4B2E4B7800020C789C5B4D0B9C7400020C7740020C138C0C1C5D00020C5C6C744AC780021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "XL 사이즈보다 커다란 잉어킹이 있으면\n어디 잡아서 보여 줘 보라지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0058004C0020C0ACC774C988BCF4B2E40020CEE4B2E4B7800020C789C5B4D0B9C7740020C788C73CBA74000AC5B4B5140020C7A1C544C11C0020BCF4C5EC0020C9180020BCF4B77CC9C00021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "2번 와일드 존에\n특대 사이즈 잉어킹이 있다는 것 같지만...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그냥 소문이지 않겠어?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0032BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C5D0000AD2B9B3000020C0ACC774C9880020C789C5B4D0B9C7740020C788B2E4B2940020AC830020AC19C9C0B9CC002E002E002E00100001BE01000AADF8B0E50020C18CBB38C774C9C00020C54AACA0C5B4003F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 잉어킹보다 커다란 잉어킹을 잡았다면\n어디 데려와 봐!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C789C5B4D0B9BCF4B2E40020CEE4B2E4B7800020C789C5B4D0B9C7440020C7A1C558B2E4BA74000AC5B4B5140020B370B824C6400020BD100021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "후후, 내 잉어킹보다\n커다란 잉어킹이 있을 리가 없지.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C4D6C4002C0020B0B40020C789C5B4D0B9BCF4B2E4000ACEE4B2E4B7800020C789C5B4D0B9C7740020C788C7440020B9ACAC000020C5C6C9C0002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "내 잉어킹에 비하면\n조그마한 사이즈인 것 같은데?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0B40020C789C5B4D0B9C5D00020BE44D558BA74000AC870ADF8B9C8D55C0020C0ACC774C988C7780020AC830020AC19C740B370003F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 무리였나 보구나!\n하하하!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020BB34B9ACC600B0980020BCF4AD6CB0980021000AD558D558D5580021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "으음!?\n그 잉어킹은...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C73CC74C0021003F000AADF80020C789C5B4D0B9C740002E002E002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "휴... 아슬아슬하게\n내 잉어킹이 이긴 것 같군.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D734002E002E002E0020C544C2ACC544C2ACD558AC8C000AB0B40020C789C5B4D0B9C7740020C774AE340020AC830020AC19AD70002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이... 이럴 수가!\n이렇게나 큰 사이즈가 존재한다고!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774002E002E002E0020C774B7F40020C218AC000021000AC774B807AC8CB0980020D0700020C0ACC774C988AC000020C874C7ACD55CB2E4ACE00021003F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐? 우두...머리?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50003F0020C6B0B450002E002E002EBA38B9AC003F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우두머리가 뭐야! 그건 반칙이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B450BA38B9ACAC000020BB50C57C00210020ADF8AC740020BC18CE59C774C57C0021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그리고 아직 승부는 끝나지 않았어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B9ACACE00020C544C9C10020C2B9BD80B2940020B05DB098C9C00020C54AC558C5B40021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잉어킹의 본질은 기술 튀어오르기에 있는 법!\n튀어오르기로 승부다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C789C5B4D0B9C7580020BCF8C9C8C7400020AE30C2200020D280C5B4C624B974AE30C5D00020C788B2940020BC950021000AD280C5B4C624B974AE30B85C0020C2B9BD80B2E40021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아, 시작이다!\n가라! 나의 XL 사이즈 잉어킹!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544002C0020C2DCC791C774B2E40021000AAC00B77C00210020B098C75800200058004C0020C0ACC774C9880020C789C5B4D0B900210021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐... 뭐가 저렇게 높아...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50002E002E002E0020BB50AC000020C800B807AC8C0020B192C544002E002E002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "졌어...\n내 완패야.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C84CC5B4002E002E002E000AB0B40020C644D328C57C002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "설마 우두머리라는 게 커다랄 뿐만 아니라\n저렇게 높이 튀어 오를 수도 있을 줄이야...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C124B9C80020C6B0B450BA38B9ACB77CB2940020AC8C0020CEE4B2E4B7840020BFD0B9CC0020C544B2C8B77C000AC800B807AC8C0020B192C7740020D280C5B40020C624B97C0020C218B3C40020C788C7440020C904C774C57C002E002E002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "우두머리...\n내게도 새로운 목표가 생겼어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C6B0B450BA38B9AC002E002E002E000AB0B4AC8CB3C40020C0C8B85CC6B40020BAA9D45CAC000020C0DDACBCC5B40021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "거대 잉어킹 군단을 만들기 위해\n2번 와일드 존으로 출격이다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC70B3000020C789C5B4D0B90020AD70B2E8C7440020B9CCB4E4AE300020C704D574000A0032BC880020C640C77CB4DC0020C874C73CB85C0020CD9CACA9C774B2E40021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나도 반드시\n우두머리 잉어킹을 발견하고 말겠어!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
